**ADR-001 Phase 3.5 PR-1 — Add `wu_pre_*` filters to `Base_Model::get_by_id` / `get_by` / `get_by_hash`**

For #1250. Cross-repo parent: [Ultimate-Multisite/ultimate-multisite-multi-tenancy#43](https://github.com/Ultimate-Multisite/ultimate-multisite-multi-tenancy/issues/43). ADR: [adr-001-sovereign-tenant-isolation](https://github.com/Ultimate-Multisite/ultimate-multisite-multi-tenancy/blob/main/docs/adr-001-sovereign-tenant-isolation.md).

## Goal

Add a single `apply_filters( "wu_pre_get_*_{$model}", null, ... )` line at the top of each of the three static getters in `Base_Model`. When the filter returns non-`null`, that value is returned and the underlying `$query_class->get_item()` call is skipped. When the filter returns `null` (default), behaviour is unchanged.

This is a strictly additive extension point. Non-sovereign installs see zero behavioural change because no callback hooks the filter.

## File

`inc/models/class-base-model.php` — three methods at lines 335, 357, 377.

## Reference pattern

```php
public static function get_by_id($item_id) {

    if (empty($item_id)) {
        return false;
    }

    $instance = new static();

    $pre = apply_filters( "wu_pre_get_by_id_{$instance->model}", null, $item_id );

    if ( null !== $pre ) {
        return $pre;
    }

    $query_class = new $instance->query_class();

    return $query_class->get_item($item_id);
}
```

Same pattern for `get_by( $column, $value )` (filter: `wu_pre_get_by_{$instance->model}`, args: `null, $column, $value`) and `get_by_hash( $item_hash )` (filter: `wu_pre_get_by_hash_{$instance->model}`, args: `null, $item_hash`).

## Verification

1. **No-callback case (default behaviour):** existing test suite green. Run `vendor/bin/phpunit` and confirm zero regressions.
2. **Filter returns null:** unit test that registers a callback returning `null`, then calls `Membership::get_by_id(123)` against a fixture row. Assert returned object equals the fixture (proves bypass is null-safe).
3. **Filter returns instance:** unit test registers a callback returning a stub `Membership` object. Assert `Membership::get_by_id(123)` returns the stub without touching `Membership_Query::get_item()` (proves short-circuit works).
4. **Filter discriminates by model:** registering `wu_pre_get_by_id_membership` must not affect `Customer::get_by_id()` calls.

## Branch

`dev-main` integration branch in this repo. Open PR against `dev-main`, not `main`.

## LOC estimate

~15 lines added across 3 methods. No deletions.

## Why this matters

Unblocks ~30 caller-site changes that would otherwise need `if (SOVEREIGN)` branches. One filter handler in the tenancy plugin (filed at `ultimate-multisite-multi-tenancy#39` sub-task 3.4.3) routes all model getter reads to the network REST client when `WU_MT_SOVEREIGN_TENANT` is defined.

## Tier

**tier:1** — single-file, well-scoped, additive.

